# The device's identity and health, from the RP (a job): firmware, board,
# clock, uptime, memory, why it last started, Booster's settings read only.
@debug
say "^Press a key" 100
key x
key o
say "^WARN  Gate overridden" 100
sayn 2 "^Press a key" 300
key i
say "^Device information" 500
say "^  Firmware  v[0-9.]+, build " 500
say "^  Board     Pico W, ID [0-9A-F]{16}" 100
say "^  Started   at power-on" 100
say "^  Wi-Fi     " 100
say "^PASS  The device reports no problem" 100
log "ST\| PASS  The device reports no problem" 500
